                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A number of places in the United States.",
                                            "The largest city in Wisconsin and the county seat of Milwaukee County."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "635298ab-a751-426b-95b3-2aed46abc8cb",
                                                "sense_id": "06d4274b-f53d-3e83-87fe-ffb50ef4e42d",
                                                "text": "During the Toronto Raptors' championship run, a fan-made sign referred to the opposing Milwaukee Bucks as the \"Milwaukee Bucktees,\" bucktee being an insult deriving from a similar word in Somali."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "123d41ea-43e7-42fd-9d71-f5efcd217563",
                                                "sense_id": "06d4274b-f53d-3e83-87fe-ffb50ef4e42d",
                                                "text": "There was no location, really — most of the convention took place in a Milwaukee of the mind. […] Instead, the teleconvention kept a few standards (like the Bruce Springsteen–soundtracked montage) and borrowed from a grab bag of other TV formats, from talk show to cable news to reality-TV reunion special."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "717419d5-2ba4-4956-ab14-63d9ebe2b883",
                                                "sense_id": "06d4274b-f53d-3e83-87fe-ffb50ef4e42d",
                                                "text": "A GoFundMe page was created by the family and talked about how Sorenson spent her last moments celebrating the beauty of life and how she had a true passion for the Milwaukee Dancing Grannies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
